<title>NEW ZEALAND: Roller Mills Fashion to change name.</title>
<headline>Roller Mills Fashion to change name.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roller Mills Fashion Company Ltd said on Friday it would apply on October 29 to change its name to Roller International Limited.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
